cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ReliefMesh in training material or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ReliefMesh"
abstract: >-
  ReliefMesh is an open-source, self-hosted and offline-first web application
  for coordinating aid requests, volunteer offers and assignments during
  disaster-response exercises and local community aid. It provides role-based
  access control, field-level encryption of personal data, an append-only
  hash-chained audit log and an offline outbox with idempotent synchronization.
  ReliefMesh is not an emergency dispatch service.
authors:
